  "content": "<h1><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/jmJ87gsb/images/527602ce254ed3b68f42d40960928767639d7760.png\" width=\"808\" height=\"444\"></h1><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><strong>关于模组：</strong></h3><p><strong>Delightful Creators</strong> 是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 的附属模组，新增了利用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 制作的合成配方。目前添加了新的流体和配方，非常适合整合包使用。</p><p>Fabric 版本可在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful-creators-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>获取！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>当前内容：</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>新增用于序列组装的不完整食物。</li>\n<li>新增汤、炖菜和酱料等流体。</li>\n<li>可通过搅拌机混合材料制作流体。</li>\n<li>可用碗盛装炖菜或汤。</li>\n<li>可切割南瓜派。</li>\n<li>新增蜂蜜曲奇和甜浆果曲奇的合成配方。</li>\n<li>新增巧克力派的合成配方。</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>本地化：</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>英文 (en_us) - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Flomik\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flomik</a></li>\n<li>俄文 (ru_ru) - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Flomik\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flomik</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fclients%252faff.php%253faff%253d6136\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4JkTnRF/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
